      "text": "Now I have enough context. Let me create a plan for the CSV export feature:\n\n## Plan: CSV Export for Invoices\n\n**Current state:** Invoice functionality doesn't exist yet on main. We have:\n- Ledger (debit/credit entries with accountId, amount, kind)\n- Formatting utilities for money and dates\n- Empty server skeleton\n\n**What I'll implement:**\n1. `invoices.js` — Invoice generation from ledger data (id, customer/accountId, date, total, currency)\n2. `csv.js` — CSV formatting helper\n3. Update `server.js` — Add endpoint for CSV export (e.g., `GET /invoices/export.csv`)\n\n**Output:** CSV with columns: `invoice_id,customer,date,total,currency`\n\nLet me start implementing:",
